### Get all orders
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### Get order by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/PUT_ORDER_ID_HERE

### Delete order by ID
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/orders/PUT_ORDER_ID_HERE